							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:BlShortcutKeymapRegistry}} is a singleton accessed via {{gtMethod:BlShortcutKeymapRegistry class>>#default}}. On initialization, it discovers all registry categories by scanning for methods annotated with {{gtPragma:gtKeymapRegistry}} (see {{gtMethod:BlShortcutKeymapRegistry>>#initializeRegistryCategories}}). This means new categories can be added from any package using extension methods."
