								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "{{gtClass:BlBasicShortcut}}\n  └─ {{gtClass:BlDynamicShortcut}} (shortcutId, registry)\n       └─ {{gtClass:BrEditorShortcut}} (name, performBlock, platform overrides)\n            └─ {{gtClass:GtSourceCoderShortcut}} (coder-specific perform)\n                 └─ {{gtClass:GtSourceCoderBrowseImplementorsShortcut}}, etc.\n       └─ {{gtClass:LeSnippetEditorShortcut}} (Lepiter snippet shortcuts)"
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
