							"string" : "Each shortcut class sets its registry connection in `initialize`. There are convenience methods:\n- {{gtMethod:BlDynamicShortcut>>#editorShortcutId:}} — connects to the editor registry\n- {{gtMethod:GtSourceCoderShortcut>>#coderShortcutId:}} — connects to the coder registry\n\nBoth internally call {{gtMethod:BlDynamicShortcut>>#shortcutId:inRegistry:}} which stores the id and registry reference."
